    19	| 0-4 | 99.4-100% | EASY |
    20	| 5-7 | 95-98.5% | EASY |
    21	| 8-9 | 80-90% | TRANSITION |
    22	| 10-11 | 54-64% | TRANSITION → HARD |
    23	| 12+ | 48-51% | RANDOM (coin flip) |
    24	
    25	**Transition width:** ~4 bits (positions 8-11)
    26	**Boundary location:** ~60% from MSB (stable across n ∈ [100, 5000])
    27	**Boundary drift:** Slight upward (more easy bits at larger n), consistent
    28	with |p(n) - R^{-1}(n)| ~ p(n)^{0.5} under RH.
